  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{LiAl}^{\\mathrm{H}}{ }_4$ can reduce $\\mathrm{COOH}$ group and not the double bond\n$\\mathrm{CH}_2=\\mathrm{CH}-\\mathrm{COOH} \\underset{\\mathrm{CH}_2=\\mathrm{CH}-\\mathrm{CH}_2 \\mathrm{OH}}{\\stackrel{\\mathrm{LAH}}{\\longrightarrow}}$"
